WEBVTT

00:03.080 --> 00:04.480
Second son

00:05.240 --> 00:06.907
You still haven't grown up

00:07.040 --> 00:09.600
The matter of Yu Gong was the Chen family's doing

00:09.680 --> 00:11.200
Just like the Xie family supporting you

00:11.280 --> 00:13.947
Also secretly tripped me up in Qing Province

00:14.520 --> 00:16.840
Not only delaying the canal's progress

00:16.920 --> 00:18.280
But also stirring up public resentment

00:18.440 --> 00:20.120
Angering His Majesty

00:20.200 --> 00:20.920
To this day

00:21.000 --> 00:23.667
Prince of Ning remains confined in the palace

00:26.880 --> 00:28.280
Looking at you

00:28.640 --> 00:30.973
You didn't know about this, did you?

00:32.840 --> 00:34.240
Second brother

00:34.440 --> 00:36.160
Even if you don't want to compete

00:36.240 --> 00:38.080
Those behind you will compete for you

00:38.160 --> 00:39.560
Make you compete

00:39.880 --> 00:41.560
Which prince of which dynasty

00:41.640 --> 00:43.040
Is not swept along?

00:43.760 --> 00:44.960
We

00:45.040 --> 00:47.160
Are the spearheads of those noble families

00:47.240 --> 00:48.640
To compete or not

00:49.280 --> 00:50.947
Is not up to us

00:51.400 --> 00:52.800
This matter

00:53.080 --> 00:55.440
From the day our father sat on the throne

00:55.520 --> 00:57.000
It began

01:01.000 --> 01:02.160
How old was your brother

01:02.240 --> 01:03.600
When you took him fishing in the river

01:03.680 --> 01:05.000
That fish

01:05.080 --> 01:06.560
Didn't you eat it too?

01:06.640 --> 01:07.760
Always protecting him like this

01:07.840 --> 01:09.160
Will lead to trouble

01:09.240 --> 01:10.360
It won't

01:10.440 --> 01:11.360
I'm the eldest

01:11.440 --> 01:13.440
I'll protect him all my life

01:15.320 --> 01:16.880
Where did the duck come from?

01:16.960 --> 01:18.320
I hunted it myself

01:18.400 --> 01:19.680
A hundred paces through a poplar

01:19.760 --> 01:22.320
This is called a hundred paces through a duck

01:22.400 --> 01:23.800
Here, try it

01:23.920 --> 01:25.000
Brother

01:25.080 --> 01:26.120
Blood

01:26.200 --> 01:27.600
Your blood

01:28.040 --> 01:28.840
You need to call the medic

01:28.920 --> 01:29.760
You can't go on like this

01:29.880 --> 01:30.640
It's fine

01:30.720 --> 01:31.600
Don't worry

01:31.680 --> 01:33.347
Let's talk on the boat

01:33.760 --> 01:34.960
Protect Prince of Jin

01:35.040 --> 01:37.373
Follow me and fight our way out

01:41.960 --> 01:43.360
Elder brother

01:44.560 --> 01:45.960
You've changed

01:46.680 --> 01:48.080
I've changed

01:52.840 --> 01:54.120
No, no, no

01:54.200 --> 01:56.040
The times have changed

